---
# Copy to content/authors/{id}.md. The file name is the author id: the page is /authors/{id}/
# and writings use it in their frontmatter as `author: {id}` (the full name also works).
name: "Full Name"
country: "Country"
photo: ""                # https://… or a file in public/, e.g. "/authors/full-name.jpg"
tagline: "One line about them"
links:                    # any label: URL
  website: "https://…"
  instagram: "https://…"
  linkedin: "https://…"
details:                  # any label: value (lists are joined with commas)
  Joined: "2025-10"
  Studies: "Program name"
  Writes in: [English, German]
---

About the author, in Markdown.
